# Don't re-pull images that are already in the local Docker daemon.
# This lets the build-ci-image job load dabneymoe-ci:latest into the local
# daemon and have all subsequent container jobs use it without hitting GHCR.
--pull=false
# Bind-mount the repo instead of copying it into each job container so files
# written inside nested `container:` jobs (e.g. server-image.tar.gz) land on
# the host workspace for local smoke tests.
--bind
